      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "As I wasn't very knowledgeable, they answered all of my silly questions and explained everything so I could understand exactly what I needed. They gave me different options on panels, inverters, panel layouts and inverter position and a hot water system timer. Which I thought was a great idea.On the day of installation, they turned up right on time. The guys were happy, friendly and totally professional. They explained the process of how the panel brackets/racks were going to be attatched to the roof and where and how they were going to put the wiring harnesses from the panels down through the roof into the garage to connect to the inverter. They really put my mind as ease. It was such a beautiful install.At the end, they installed the app on my phone and explained how it all worked and what to do if there was any problem. The grid connection was all done for me and they followed up with a courtesy call the next day to see if I had any questions. I couldn't be happier with the service I received and how quick and smooth everything went.",
