      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Including our 4kW Solar System we also received a 190lt Heat Pump water system. Ours was older than the ten commandments and was going to be replaced, as it was insufficient for our house anyway (only 90lt). We were advised by the company to replace it with a heat pump hot water system. We got both the Solar and heat pump, both installed for $10k on the dot.Every other avenue and quote we investigated was going to bring us in at $12k to $13k with a similar deal ($15k if we went with a ordinary Hot Water system as there was cost to change over to Tar 33, and that's after Government rebate)So I think we got a great deal with great advice.P.S. Infinity Solar Maroochydore were also good sports and deserve a mention. Even though we did go with another installer, they too gave great advice and even said that the systems, the pricing and how our installer was configuring them for our situation, was the best way to go.",
